        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING: This game may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539710/extras/a115f5320d04cb05d3be5d186faf6b51.avif?t=1766491459\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539710/extras_big/a115f5320d04cb05d3be5d186faf6b51.avif?t=1766491459 width=800 height=350 /></span>Shroom Man's Destination is a 2D arena shooter roguelike where you fight through rooms filled with randomly spawning enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout various encounters, players will collect powerful items to help them escape the underground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>During your journey you will find:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over <strong>100</strong> different items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9</strong> challenging bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more than <strong>40</strong> varied enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4</strong> randomly generated floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539710/extras/9f7b098bdf94f984a6ad2ca2ad65853d.avif?t=1766491459\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539710/extras_big/9f7b098bdf94f984a6ad2ca2ad65853d.avif?t=1766491459 width=800 height=154 /></span></p></li></ul>",
